<section class="card">

<h2>
项目概述
<span class="en">Project Overview</span>
</h2>

<p>
本项目针对肺癌脑膜转移这一临床难题，基于头部MRI医学影像构建人工智能预测系统。肺癌脑膜转移（LM）是肺癌最严重的并发症之一，早期准确诊断对患者治疗方案选择和预后至关重要。本项目通过深度学习与多模态融合技术，为临床医生提供智能辅助诊断工具。
<span class="en">This project addresses the clinical challenge of lung cancer leptomeningeal metastasis (LM) by building an AI prediction system based on head MRI. LM is one of the most severe complications of lung cancer, and early accurate diagnosis is critical for treatment planning and prognosis. This project provides an intelligent diagnostic tool for clinicians through deep learning and multimodal fusion.</span>
</p>

</section>

